==French==

===Etymology===
Probably from {{etyl|LL.|fr}} *{{term||(in) hanc hora|until this hour}} or *{{term||hinc ad horam}}, but the development is disputed. Compare Occitan {{term|encara}}, Italian {{term|ancora}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ɑ̃.kɔʁ/|lang=fr}}
* {{audio|fr-encore.ogg|Audio (France)}}

===Adverb===
{{fr-adv}}

# [[still]]
#: ''Vous êtes '''encore''' là?''
#:: Are you '''still''' here?
# [[more]]
#: ''Voulez-vous '''encore''' du [[pain]]?''
#:: Would you like '''more''' [[bread]]?
#: ''Tu en veux '''encore'''?''
#:: You want some '''more'''?
# [[again]]
#: '''''Encore''' une fois.''
#:: Once '''again'''.
# [[yet]]
#: ''Je n'ai pas encore fini.''
#:: I haven't finished '''yet'''

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|still}} [[toujours]]

